g/t/p/original/6zptpFDMvMFhMuFgqsvNm7OI36t.jpg"},{"id":4485226,"name":"Junichiro Yagawa","role":"Sawako's Friend"},{"id":3127210,"name":"Mari Nakamura","role":"Sawako Mother"},{"id":555155,"name":"Shinji Nomura","role":"Sawako Father","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5KbykCj63cYOt4t2B186eqNau0t.jpg"},{"id":2367522,"name":"Gambino Kobayashi","role":"Hitman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/FY6boPKtAHdmqRJKyncUIZqeY9.jpg"},{"id":4147943,"name":"Daiki Sugawara","role":"Primary Student"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Dolls","overview":"Tre storie d'amore infelice si incontrano attraverso le quattro stagioni. Due vagabondi legati da una corda rossa, erano stati una coppia felice; un anziano capo yakuza torna nei giardini dove trent'anni prima era solito pranzare con la fidanzata; uno sfegatato fan di una cantante pop si acceca per incontrarla, sulla spiaggia dove lei, sfigurata, è ferma a fissare il mare."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dolls","overview":"Dolls takes puppeteering as its overriding motif, which relates thematically to the action provided by the live characters. Chief among those tales is the story of Matsumoto and Sawako, a young couple whose relationship is about to be broken apart by the former's parents, who have insisted their son take part in an arranged marriage to his boss' daughter.","tagline":"Three stories of never-ending love."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"近松門左衛門の悲恋の傑作「冥途の飛脚」に登場する人形に語り部としての役割を持たせ、３つの純愛ストーリーを微妙に交わらせながら紡ぎだす北野武の意欲作。松本（西島）は社長令嬢との結婚のために捨てた恋人の佐和子（菅野）が自殺未遂したことを知る。しかし、駆けつけた彼が目にしたのは、全ての記憶をなくした彼女の姿だった…。ほかに老境にさしかかったヤクザ（三橋）と彼をひたすら待ち続ける女（松原）、事故で片目を失ったアイドル（深田）と彼女を慕い続ける青年（武重勉）の悲恋を描く。山本耀司の斬新な衣装も話題を呼んだ。","tagline":"あなたに、ここに、いてほしい。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gEI8JJPayOrdfy0AjdWQ92A90cc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cxULojvpOWYX8AUG5eJpTYS8IbX.j